  "title": "Vasco da Gama reaches Calicut",
  "summary": "Vasco da Gama's fleet left the Tagus near Lisbon on 8 July 1497, rounded the Cape of Good Hope in November, called at Mombasa and Malindi on the East African coast, and reached the Malabar coast near Calicut on 18 May 1498. The ships returned to Portugal separately in July and August 1499.",
